		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Green, fungus-covered maid. Can control plants and mushroom-things. Blend of succubus and fungus-folk.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tendril +3 (1d4 + will drain), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> -2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Plant Empathy</strong>. Command plant or fungus creatures within near, CHA 15+ to resist.</p><p></p><p><strong>Spore Step</strong>. Step inside large fungus within close. May teleport far to another large fungus.</p><p></p><p><strong>Will Drain</strong>. CON 15+ or take 1d4 CHA damage. Dies and becomes spore zombie at 0 CHA.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
